{"name":"Purskul","status":"ok","title":"Purskul","pageId":14355,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Purskul</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue\">Lands of Intrigue</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Town<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br>Metropolis<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"demonym\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Demonym</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Purskan<sup id=\"cite_ref-vol-p56_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vol-p56-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halfling</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">half-orc</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chauntea\" title=\"Chauntea\">Chauntea</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12,000<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370&#160;DR</a><br>27,210<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"poptable\"><b>Population History</b><br><small><i>circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>:</small><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 40%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a>  </td><td> 30%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a>  </td><td> 29%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">Orc</a>  </td><td> 1%  </td></tr></tbody></table><small><i>circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>:</small><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a>  </td><td> 15%  </td></tr></tbody></table></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Purskul\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Purskul\">Inhabitants of  Purskul</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Purskul\" title=\"Category:Locations in Purskul\">Locations in  Purskul</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Purskul\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Purskul\">Organizations in  Purskul</a></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Purskul</b> was a city in <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Demographics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Demographics</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Industry\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Industry</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Locations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Locations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Demographics\">Demographics</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Demographics\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Demographics\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>, Purskul was recorded as having a population of around 12,000 people, comprising 40% <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">humans</a>, 30% <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">halflings</a>, 29% <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">half-orcs</a>, and 1% full-blooded <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orcs</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> <i>Circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, it was recorded to have a population of 27,210 people, marking it as a metropolis. Half-orcs accounted 15% of this value.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>note 1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The large half-orc population dated back to <a href=\"/wiki/1235_DR\" title=\"1235 DR\">1235 DR</a>, when the armies of Amn, while battling with humanoid forces, captured many orcs and forced them to work at labor camps in Purskul. Those who worked the hardest were granted their freedom. Their descendants made up the later orcish population.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI-A-p33_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI-A-p33-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Industry\">Industry</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Industry\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Industry\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was a granary city and an important caravan stop. The half-orc inhabitants generally worked as caravan guards and mercenaries.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There was a temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Chauntea\" title=\"Chauntea\">Chauntea</a>, but it was left empty after its <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">clerics</a> fell sick and died around <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p154_2-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p154-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i>  <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<small><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Third edition saw widespread alterations in population figures, accounting for this discrepancy.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></small>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Purskul?veact